{"type":"message","id":"5984b097","parentId":"9376373d","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:10:58.685Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can clearly see the issue now. The logs show repeated HTTP 429 errors from the Feishu (Lark) API:\n\n```\nAxiosError: Request failed with status code 429\n    url: 'https://open.larksuite.com/open-apis/bot/v1/openclaw_bot/ping'\n```\n\nThis is the Feishu ping/heartbeat endpoint being rate-limited. The bot (xiaoye account with token `t-g2075gdME65Z67BW2JPUANXFFU377AMUITDDLI6U`) is getting 429 Too Many Requests responses when trying to ping the Lark bot API.\n\nKey observations:\n1. The pings are happening every ~30 seconds (at 14:53:03, 14:54:03, 14:56:03, 14:58:02, 14:59:42, 15:01:03, 15:03:03, 15:04:04, 15:06:03, 15:08:03)\n2. Feishu API is rate-limiting the pings\n3. The bot itself seems to be able to receive messages (there are successes too - \"dispatch complete\" with replies)\n4. But pings are consistently getting 429 responses\n\nThe issue is that the OpenClaw Feishu channel is sending heartbeat/ping requests too frequently to the Lark API, and the token/app is being rate-limited. \n\nThis could be because:\n1. The ping interval is too aggressive\n2. The app credentials (appId: cli_a965de5a7b78de17 for xiaoye) might have hit a rate limit on the Lark API side\n3. The WebSocket connection mode might be generating too many pings\n\nLet me check if there's a way to adjust the ping interval or if we need to just restart the Feishu plugin to reset the rate limit state.\n\nAlso, there's a stuck session issue: `agent:wxlee:feishu:xiaoye:direct:ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50` has been in \"processing\" state for a very long time.\n\nLet me check for the Feishu plugin configuration to see if there's a ping interval setting, and also look at the WebSocket connection mode.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到症结了。看日志一目了然——飞书通道的 ping/heartbeat 请求被 Lark API 限流了，持续返回 **HTTP 429 (Too Many Requests)**。\n\n让我进一步查清楚限制的来源和可调"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_59a990c0f4cf47b999b789e4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\ncfg = json.load(sys.stdin)\ne = cfg.get('extensions', {})\nprint(json.dumps(e, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))\n\" 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8f0acacdd80d4d9e87de5f9d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /app/dist/extensions/feishu/ 2>/dev/null && cat /app/dist/extensions/feishu/package.json 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(json.dumps({k:v for k,v in d.items() if k in ['name','version','openclaw']}, indent=2))\" 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778944198360,"responseId":"5d49923a5cdb4a97ab4d91282247dde9"}}
